  "body": "# ZYRAXON v6.5.0\n\n**In-app auto-update, plus the voice, microphone, memory and settings fixes.**\n\n## What's new\n\n### ⬆️ In-app auto-update\n- **Settings → আপডেট (Update)** scans the latest GitHub release automatically and\n  compares versions numerically (so 6.10.0 is correctly newer than 6.9.0).\n- A single **Download & Install** button streams the APK with live progress and\n  installs it **in place**. The installed app is replaced — chats, memories and\n  settings are kept, and no second app is ever installed.\n- If Android blocks the install, the app opens the exact \"install unknown apps\"\n  row for itself and lets you retry.\n- A **launch banner** appears when a newer release exists, with a **close (✕)**\n  button so it can be dismissed.\n\n### 🎙️ Microphone\n- The microphone no longer turns off and on again for every sentence of a reply.\n  It opens once and closes once per turn.\n\n### 🔊 Voice\n- Text-to-speech works again, and English words are read as words, not spelled\n  out letter by letter.\n- Both the male and the female voice work reliably, and speech is spoken in real\n  time, word by word.\n\n### 🧠 Memory\n- The assistant recalls conversations from months back.\n\n### ⚙️ Settings\n- Settings, the selected model and the last open tab persist across app restarts.\n\n## Notes\n- Version: **6.5.0** (versionCode 13), package `com.zyraxon.assistant`.\n- This build is signed with a **new key**. The previous key was lost, so if you\n  have an older ZYRAXON installed you must **uninstall it once** before installing\n  v6.5.0. Every update after this one installs in place.\n\n## Install\nDownload `ZYRAXON-v6.5.0.apk` below and open it on your phone.\n\n**SHA-256:** see `ZYRAXON-v6.5.0.apk.sha256`."
